# FosOS: users in group sudo may elevate without a password.
# The account password still protects login and the lock screen.
# Named 99-* so this rule wins over Calamares' 10-installer
# (user ALL=(ALL) ALL), which would otherwise re-require a password.
# Owned by root:root mode 0440 (enforced in postinst).
%sudo ALL=(ALL:ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
